{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=952 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.mp4?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build, grow and place large bioengineered organs to automate production. Use pulsating conveyor intestines to transport material.\u00a0<strong>Here, industry thrives not on steel but on flesh.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/ebbde79138dda0144cdd9c40aa546986.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=940 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/ebbde79138dda0144cdd9c40aa546986.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Mine and harvest pulsating biomass flesh to turn into usable organic matter for your factory. Grow and assemble new materials and fleshy biomachines. Feed your hive-mind brain to unlock new genetic technologies and new organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b51836be1e6a44a27c47d388a69f813a.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=920 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b51836be1e6a44a27c47d388a69f813a.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Fuel your organic machines with grotesque beating hearts pumping kcal-dense coolant as an energy source.\u00a0Process fluids and gasses, Transport cargo filled with processed materials across long distances using flesh biodrones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/71d15cc6556d9e2d28ab59f71f369c80.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=986 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/71d15cc6556d9e2d28ab59f71f369c80.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dispose of byproducts/waste, or store it in barrels for future recycling. The viscous waste sludge might still have some nutritional value worth extracting... if you choose to set up a waste refinement system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/2d5011146ba7333d4e15701f393dcb25.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compress material using bioindustrial waste compactors into cubes for more efficient storage and transport or shred and liquify meat sludge before feeding it to your large biorefineries or large advanced stomaches with multiple stomach chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>rogue Hive Mind Brain</strong>, originally built by a large biotech corporation tasked to operate large scale factories on a terraforming planet, but your grotesque brain quickly started to evolve out of control and grow your own means of production across wide corrupted landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a large biofactory and finish the end-goal by launching your factory-replicating gene seed into space to become the ultimate space parasite, infecting planets to breed new biofactories<i>.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-view overview to focus on factory-building and see the insides of your animated organ machinery come to life as they process and churn out materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/8e08117237a826cdba28fec96225cca9.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/fee6475c2ad21f021af0e7b86168a7cb.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/fee6475c2ad21f021af0e7b86168a7cb.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community on Discord!</strong> Share your feedback, drop suggestions, or sign up for upcoming playtests.<br>THE DISCORD SERVER HUNGERS FOR MORE FLESH\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/f35f4bfa2c4c50b79981bdf74f498016.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=322 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3469420?t=1773500071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773500071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/7374f0f5e1d1cfd7e0e72567d78de2376232add5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773500071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/7374f0f5e1d1cfd7e0e72567d78de2376232add5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773500071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game can contain some cartoony blood and overall usage of cartoony organs, such as a pulsating heart, brain and stomach."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=952 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b01157b4047f626053b83408af26d19d.mp4?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build, grow and place large bioengineered organs to automate production. Use pulsating conveyor intestines to transport material.\u00a0<strong>Here, industry thrives not on steel but on flesh.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/ebbde79138dda0144cdd9c40aa546986.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=940 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/ebbde79138dda0144cdd9c40aa546986.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Mine and harvest pulsating biomass flesh to turn into usable organic matter for your factory. Grow and assemble new materials and fleshy biomachines. Feed your hive-mind brain to unlock new genetic technologies and new organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b51836be1e6a44a27c47d388a69f813a.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=920 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/b51836be1e6a44a27c47d388a69f813a.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Fuel your organic machines with grotesque beating hearts pumping kcal-dense coolant as an energy source.\u00a0Process fluids and gasses, Transport cargo filled with processed materials across long distances using flesh biodrones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/71d15cc6556d9e2d28ab59f71f369c80.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=986 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/71d15cc6556d9e2d28ab59f71f369c80.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dispose of byproducts/waste, or store it in barrels for future recycling. The viscous waste sludge might still have some nutritional value worth extracting... if you choose to set up a waste refinement system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/2d5011146ba7333d4e15701f393dcb25.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compress material using bioindustrial waste compactors into cubes for more efficient storage and transport or shred and liquify meat sludge before feeding it to your large biorefineries or large advanced stomaches with multiple stomach chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>rogue Hive Mind Brain</strong>, originally built by a large biotech corporation tasked to operate large scale factories on a terraforming planet, but your grotesque brain quickly started to evolve out of control and grow your own means of production across wide corrupted landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a large biofactory and finish the end-goal by launching your factory-replicating gene seed into space to become the ultimate space parasite, infecting planets to breed new biofactories<i>.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-view overview to focus on factory-building and see the insides of your animated organ machinery come to life as they process and churn out materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/8e08117237a826cdba28fec96225cca9.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/fee6475c2ad21f021af0e7b86168a7cb.poster.avif?t=1773500071\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/fee6475c2ad21f021af0e7b86168a7cb.webm?t=1773500071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community on Discord!</strong> Share your feedback, drop suggestions, or sign up for upcoming playtests.<br>THE DISCORD SERVER HUNGERS FOR MORE FLESH\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/f35f4bfa2c4c50b79981bdf74f498016.avif?t=1773500071\" width=800 height=322 /></span></p>","developers":["Bioreactor Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/0eadd18f9bbd6d243507acb57cf5b7cc3cde5f55/header.jpg?t=1773500071","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Bioreactor Studios BV - All rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> </li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3469420/482980406/80919283204962919c891bc83e9cdfafa267657a/1773499562/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773500070","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3469420/482980406/8091928